# Sudden Setback {2}{U}{U}: "The owner of target spell or nonland permanent puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library." A Mox Ruby is a nonland permanent:
# Bot1 targets Bot2's Mox Ruby on turn 2 and Bot2, its owner, chooses the top (accept); then Bot1 targets Bot2's Lightning Bolt spell on turn 4 and Bot2 declines: the
# bottom. Bot2's Island is a land, so it is refused as a target (CR 115.1). Neither is countered, so the Bolt never deals damage and neither is in a graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Sudden Setback
Sudden Setback
Island
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: U)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Sudden Setback.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Sudden Setback.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby)
Bot2.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield = Island
? Bot2.Library.Top = Mox Ruby
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sudden Setback.Cast(Stack.Lightning Bolt)
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard =
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Mox Ruby
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot2.Library = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
